// f37_sat_confirm.sing
// Decisive Groebner facts establishing that the f37 branch of the (72,108)
// resultant master identity  f31 * f37 * d_-1^21 == 0  is a resultant artifact:
// f31 already lies in the pre-resultant ideal, so EVERY solution of the
// original (pre-resultant) system satisfies f31 = 0 and none lies on
// {f37 = 0} \ {f31 = 0}.
//
// Self-contained (all polynomials inline).  Run with:
//     cat f37_sat_confirm.sing | Singular -q
// On this Windows box (WSL cannot see /mnt/c), pipe via stdin:
//     cat f37_sat_confirm.sing | wsl.exe -d Ubuntu -- bash -lc 'cd $HOME && Singular -q'
//
// Vars: d2,d1,d0 = tilde-d_{2,1,0}; m1 = d_-1; dm2,dm3,dm4 = d_{-2,-3,-4}; P = Phi.
// PART 1 uses the full G-system <G1,G2,G3,G5body+Phi> (STATE.md item 4).
// PART 2 independently re-derives the result from the H-system <H2,H3,H5>
// (the resultant path of regenerate_system.py / F37_FREE_FAMILY_SYSTEM.md),
// saturated by m1.  All polynomials denominator-cleared to integer coeffs.

